module Core

### Represents the crashable raised when a byte sequence cannot be decoded as
### well-formed UTF-8.
crashable MalformedUtf8Error
  ### Stores the byte index where decoding failed.
  index: U64
  ### Stores a short description of the decoding failure.
  reason: Text

### Returns the default message for malformed UTF-8 input.
### :returns: The resulting `Text` value.
routine MalformedUtf8Error.crash_message() -> Text
  return f"Malformed UTF-8 at byte {me.index}: {me.reason}."
